OL,3,AStourbridge fires that razed 19 homes
OL,4,Aaccidental
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo fires that destroyed 19 homes in
OL,7,FStourbridge were started accidentally
OL,8,Fin fields where farming machinery was
OL,9,Fin use, according to West Midlands Fire
OL,10,FService.
OL,12,FInvestigators established farming
OL,13,Fequipment was being used in the
OL,14,Fvicinity of fields immediately before
OL,15,Fthe fires were first reported.
OL,17,FThe first fire started in a field near
OL,18,FRacecourse Lane at about 13:27 BST on
OL,19,F13 August, while a second began shortly
OL,20,Fafterwards in a field near Quarry Park
OL,21,FRoad.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
